<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amazon.com started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amazon.com started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it started coverage of online bookseller Amazon.com Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates are for loss $1.20 per share in 1997 and loss $0.90 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month target price of $26 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 5/8 to 19-5/8.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Amazon.com shares were off 3/4 at 19-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
